Description: Local Ethereum and EVM wallet signing in pure R: keccak-256 hashing, secp256k1 ECDSA with Ethereum recovery id and low-s, EIP-712 typed-data signing, and address derivation. The cryptographic primitives needed to authenticate and sign orders on EVM venues such as Hyperliquid and Polymarket.
